{
  "bookId": "hero-212102",
  "id": "bond-28553",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28553001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "嗨多磨！我是绊爱！又在直播间里跟大家见面了，你们有没有想我呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "咦？！人呢？观众呢！弹幕呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "「A.I.Channel」还从没有这么冷清的时候呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "试试这间特别为你准备的直播间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "嗯……这很可疑……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28553007",
              "text": "不想要是吧？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28553007",
              "text": "那么我收回。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28553006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "开玩笑的啦哈哈哈哈哈~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "既然你盛情邀请，我就不客气咯，会尽情把这里当作自己家的~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "进来吧，直播马上开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "呼呀！心脏感觉像是揣了一只兔子“乒乒乒”要跳出来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "嗨多磨，聪明可爱的虚拟偶像绊爱作为1/7手办登场了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28553012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Kizuna AI",
          "text": "和平日里一样的装扮，头顶调皮的晃悠悠，就这样可爱、可爱满满的工作吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
